    /// 2. Validates that a ParentItem exists before allowing menu close
    ///    If ParentItem is null, cancels the close event to prevent orphaned menus
    ///
    /// This ensures proper menu hierarchy maintenance and prevents UI state corruption
    /// in both desktop and adaptive (mobile) UI modes.
